formed, but would also allow you to leave your general discussion section for a broader discussion about the utility of 
this method, comparing your five different contexts and bringing in details as necessary. This is not to say that you co
uldn’t, if you preferred, keep all of your literature review content at the beginning of the thesis, and have one very
